{"version":1,"content":"<p>研究團隊分析了採自巴布亞新幾內亞古德諾夫島的一塊榴輝巖，重建出它約440萬年前隨俯衝板塊下沉、深入地幔後又返回地表的過程。巖石中的石榴石包裹着微小柯石英，這種礦物需要極高壓力才能形成，證明巖石曾下沉至至少90公裏深處；當地温估計約為800攝氏度。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585424.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.673194+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:12:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:57:11.755826+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"f24d56346ded1b8fb45399914fa3a08fb13ca69c3992d1cf72e40fc4484ee3f9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}